flowchart TD

  %% INGESTION
  A[Audio File] --> B[Store Raw Audio]

  A --> C[Speech-to-Text Transcription]

  C --> D[Transcript with Timestamps]

  D --> E[Transcript Segment Splitter]

  E --> F1[Segment 1<br/>00:00-00:30]
  E --> F2[Segment 2<br/>00:30-01:00]
  E --> F3[Segment N]

  F1 --> G[Sentence Splitter]
  F2 --> G
  F3 --> G

  G --> H1[Sentence 1<br/>Timestamp]
  G --> H2[Sentence 2<br/>Timestamp]
  G --> H3[Sentence N<br/>Timestamp]

  H1 --> I[Store Transcript Sentences]
  H2 --> I
  H3 --> I

  I --> J[Create Overlapping Chunks]

  J --> K1[Chunk 1<br/>Sentences 1-3]
  J --> K2[Chunk 2<br/>Sentences 3-5]
  J --> K3[Chunk N]

  K1 --> L[Generate Embedding]
  K2 --> L
  K3 --> L

  L --> M[(Vector Database)]

  B --> N[(Audio Files Table)]
  D --> O[(Transcript Table)]
  I --> P[(Transcript Sentences Table)]
  J --> Q[(Chunks Table)]

  %% RETRIEVAL
  R[User Query] --> S[Generate Query Embedding]

  S --> M

  M --> T[Top Matching Chunks]

  T --> U[Chunk Metadata]

  U --> V[Find Original Transcript Sentences]

  P --> V
  O --> V
  N --> V

  V --> W[Expand Context<br/>Previous + Next Sentences]

  W --> X[Evidence Block]

  X --> Y[LLM Answer Generation]

  Y --> Z[Answer + Citation]

  %% TRACEABILITY
  X --> AA[Source Metadata]

  AA --> AB[Audio Title]
  AA --> AC[Speaker]
  AA --> AD[Timestamp Range]
  AA --> AE[Transcript Excerpt]

  AB[Audio Title] --> AF[Answer with Clickable Evidence]
  AC[Speaker] --> AF[Answer with Clickable Evidence]
  AD[Timestamp Range] --> AF[Answer with Clickable Evidence]
  AE[Transcript Excerpt] --> AF[Answer with Clickable Evidence]

  Z --> AF[Answer with Clickable Evidence]